+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-5">Phone: (703) 893-3500 x2350</t>
+      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-6">On-line messages will reach me addressed to either<br/>POSTEL@ISI<br/>or<br/>JBP in the NIC Journal.</t>
     </abstract>
